      "title": "fix(session): preserve guest monotonic time after long pauses",
      "summary": "The pause clock compensation was limited to plasmashell, although session guests load the same preload. A long background pause therefore exposed the full CLOCKMONOTONIC gap to guest processes. The report log shows SIGCONT at 15:31:57.381, 2065 MB left in zRAM at 15:31:57.447, and the game window closing at 15:32:01.216. The zRAM pass also ran at 15:32:00.528, so memory pressure remains an op",
